{"nodes": [{"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_this_in_methods_how_methods_lose_this_call_site_this", "label": "this from the call site", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/this-in-methods/how-methods-lose-this.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "obj.f() binds this to obj. Finding an inherited method and resolving properties it reads are two lookups that can land at different levels. Methods are not owned by their object."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_this_in_methods_how_methods_lose_this_detached_method", "label": "Detached method", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/this-in-methods/how-methods-lose-this.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Assigning, destructuring, or passing obj.method as a callback drops the receiver. Strict (modules/classes) gives undefined and TypeError; sloppy substitutes globalThis and silently creates globals."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_this_in_methods_how_methods_lose_this_thisarg", "label": "Array method thisArg", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/this-in-methods/how-methods-lose-this.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "forEach/map/filter/some/every/find/findIndex/flatMap take a thisArg. reduce/reduceRight use the second argument as initialValue; sort has none. Arrows work everywhere."}], "edges": [{"source": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_this_in_methods_how_methods_lose_this_detached_method", "target": "build_css_p2_docs_